      "id": "2102492256859259336",
      "text": "Northernlion actually holds a special place for me as his Isaac videos got me through a tough time in my life.\n\nPolitics aside, NL definitely knew who Dan was as a person. Throwing your friend of 14 years under the bus over streamer drama is disgusting. He really lost my respect.",
