      "isPromoted": false,
      "quotedTweet": {
        "id": "2102475219428606142",
        "text": "Asmongold unleashes on “pathetic loser” Northernlion for how he handled his long time friend Dan Gheesling’s US Army sponsorship\n\n\"You have nasty disgusting 2 faced weasels like Northernlion who's sitting there in chat, but he's audience captured and afraid of his own viewers that the moment they dislike it, he has to do a cam off crying stream complaining about his friend who he's known for apparently 14 years..absolutely pathetic..I don't respect the person that does this at all\"\n\n\"This is the most important thing..he acknowledges (in chat)..he's responding to thinking of enlisting, that means he obviously knows what's going on..flipped the script on his friend for over 10 years, bc he's afraid of hate on the internet..pathetic f'in weasel..this guy is a f'in loser..I didn't know somebody could be this big of a B\"\n\n\"They're totally fake and the only thing they're doing is siding with these people so they can farm anti American freaks in their audience, I hate them..if you engage in something like this, you will get farmed..I hope other people make videos..I can't even express how much I hate these people without breaking the ToS..never seen somebody c-c-k out like this..I think he's crying, omg\"\n\n\"He'll probably respond..I will be there to make it worse, just like he was there to make it worse for Dan, bc Dan has the audacity to support his own country's military. It's what you deserve, sorry\"",
        "author": {
          "screenName": "Awk20000",
          "name": "yeet"
        }
      }
    },
